Project-local agent instructions for the **shared agent stack** (Claude / Codex / Cursor / Grok / Oh My Pi). Do **not** invent a parallel workflow. **Never** wire or use codebase-memory.

> Scaffold rule: if an `AGENTS.md` or `CLAUDE.md` already exists, **preserve** it — do not overwrite without explicit user approval. Prefer merge notes or nested files.

## CLI contract (prefer these)

| Layer | Tool | How |
|-------|------|-----|
| Shell output | **RTK** (`rtk`) | Prefix shell with `rtk` when useful. See `RTK.md`. |
| Tasks / memory | **beads (`bd`)** | SoT: `bd ready`, `bd update --claim`, `bd close`. |
| Traffic compress | **headroom** | `headroom wrap …` when available. |
| Code structure | **tokensave only** | context/search/callers/impact. **Never codebase-memory.** |
| Tool/MCP flood | **context-mode** | Large reads → sandbox. |
| Structural edits | **ast-grep** (`sg`) | AST over regex sed. |
| External docs | **context7** | Library docs. |
| Output brevity | **caveman** | `/caveman` |
| Code minimalism | **ponytail** | `/ponytail` |

